              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Leila Maglione Lane"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I like a more hearty pancake, so I omitted 1/4 cup of the flour and added ground flax and oat flour to make the difference. I also added a little vanilla extract. They were delicious. This is an excellent base pancake recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2018-01-29T00:33:12.100Z"
