              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chris Forbes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made it according to the recipe, and it made good pancakes. They weren't as good as my typical recipe, but they were easier and didn't require special ingredients. I will make these again when I need to combine the dry and wet ingredients in advance or when I'm in a hurry.",
