            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HandyOat5940"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I found this recipe 15 years ago…it’s hands down the absolute best pancake recipe I’ve ever tried. We’ve had years of success with it &amp; have only made 1 adjustment - replaced the vegetable oil w rapeseed oil. My wife has a soybean allergy, so we switched it up &amp; never looked back. Rapeseed oil is so much lighter than vegetable oil, it is tasteless so there’s absolutely no change to flavor, but the end result is a lighter/fluffier/better pancake. Give it a try.",
            "datePublished": "2023-07-04T16:10:37.586Z"
